1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,380
What if you had 10 arms for one day?

2
00:00:02,520 --> 00:00:04,280
You'd think you'd get 5 times more done.

3
00:00:04,440 --> 00:00:05,600
You'd probably get less.

4
00:00:05,860 --> 00:00:06,080
Why?

5
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:09,320
Your brain has a body map, and it was built for 2 arms.

6
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:10,140
The other 8?

7
00:00:10,140 --> 00:00:10,600
No map.

8
00:00:10,780 --> 00:00:11,640
They just flop around.

9
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:14,960
Scientists have trained people to use a robotic extra thumb.

10
00:00:15,040 --> 00:00:16,460
So your brain can learn.

11
00:00:16,620 --> 00:00:17,600
Just not in one day.

12
00:00:17,780 --> 00:00:21,640
So today, you're a very confused human slapping yourself 8 times.

13
00:00:21,820 --> 00:00:24,440
Good news: you only need 1 arm to hit subscribe.
